        "created_at": "2015-01-27T18:06:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easiest way to think about line of sight is that, if there is a hex between the two characters that has an elevation <em>higher</em> than either character, they do not have line of sight.</p>\n<p>And welcome to the forums! Glad to have you!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>",
